UUID: 32820fea-71d8-35f3-bebd-34893ec6cc54
Mixing of lubricant and petrol (ratio 1:50) at the petrol station.
Location: CH
Technology: Mixing of two-stroke petrol at the fuel station.
Time period: Literature publication for mixing ratio and time of estimation.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Own estimation based on mixing ratio. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_32820fea-71d8-35f3-bebd-34893ec6cc54.xml</text>
